kdown</span></div></button><a class="dropdown-item view-markdown-link external" href="../posts/Penny-for-Your-Thoughts/llms.txt" target="_blank" data-no-popover="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 1.75C2 .784 2.784 0 3.75 0h6.586c.464 0 .909.184 1.237.513l2.914 2.914c.329.328.513.773.513 1.237v9.586A1.75 1.75 0 0113.25 16h-9.5A1.75 1.75 0 012 14.25V1.75zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 00-.25.25v12.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h9.5a.25.25 0 00.25-.25V6h-2.75A1.75 1.75 0 019 4.25V1.5H3.75zm6.75.062V4.25c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2.688a.252.252 0 00-.011-.013l-2.914-2.914a.272.272 0 00-.013-.011z"></path></svg><div class="dropdown-item-content"><span class="dropdown-item-title">View as Markdown <span class="external-arrow">↗</span></span></div></a><a class="dropdown-item honcho-link external" data-slug="posts/Penny-for-Your-Thoughts" href="#" target="_blank" data-no-popover="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" height="16" width="16" viewBox="0 0 87 77"><path d="M55.29 0H38.77V6.89H55.29V0Z"></path><path d="M65.95 6.89H55.29V13.69H65.95V6.89Z"></path><path d="M72.66 13.69H65.95V20.4H72.66V13.69Z"></path><path d="M79.54 20.4H72.66V30.17H79.54V20.4Z"></path><path d="M86.33 30.16H79.54V46.54H86.33V30.16Z"></path><path d="M79.54 46.55H72.67V56.32H79.54V46.55Z"></path><path d="M72.67 56.31H65.95V63.11H72.67V56.31Z"></path><path d="M65.95 63.11H55.29V69.96H65.95V63.11Z"></path><path d="M55.29 69.96H35.84V76.65H55.29V69.96Z"></path><path d="M35.84 63.11H25.18V69.96H35.84V63.11Z"></path><path d="M25.18 56.31H18.39V63.11H25.18V56.31Z"></path><path d="M18.39 46.55H11.52V56.32H18.39V46.55Z"></path><path d="M4.87 33.97V20.4H0V40.8H4.87V46.55H11.52V33.97H4.87Z"></path><path d="M18.31 27.17H11.52V33.96H18.31V27.17Z"></path><path d="M38.77 6.89H18.39V13.69H38.77V6.89Z"></path><path d="M45.5 13.69H38.79V20.4H45.5V13.69Z"></path><path d="M18.32 27.17H38.79V20.4H18.39V13.69H4.87V20.4H18.32V27.17Z"></path><path d="M38.